# Owner-only guardrail (learners clone and never push, so this is just for me).
# This is the exercise working folder: only the .log fixtures belong in the repo.
# Everything I create while practising here — my own triage.sh, scratch .txt,
# anything — stays local. So ignore it all, then re-include the two fixtures
# (the root .gitignore's *.log rule would otherwise exclude them).
*
!.gitignore
!access.log
!app.log
